{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":46424,"num_turns":1,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1e32bd6b-0e3f-4c9d-bd55-a5b9867f0efb","total_cost_usd":0.200016,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10659,"cache_read_input_tokens":20828,"output_tokens":3128,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10659,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3128,"cache_read_input_tokens":20828,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10659},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":4732,"outputTokens":14,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.004802,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-opus-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":3128,"cacheReadInputTokens":20828,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10659,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.195214,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"agent\":\"debris-flavourist\",\"pieces\":[{\"id\":\"scorched_hull_panel\",\"display_name\":\"Scorched Hull Panel\",\"flavour\":\"A sheet of somebody's outer wall, one side blackened. Light enough to tuck under an arm, cheap enough that nobody down there fights you for it.\",\"reads_as\":[\"light\",\"low\",\"cheap\",\"small\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"bent_truss_section\",\"display_name\":\"Bent Truss Section\",\"flavour\":\"Structural spar with a permanent kink in it, still solid where it counts. Low scrap off the cheap end of the band, and it knows it.\",\"reads_as\":[\"low\",\"cheap\",\"solid\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"cracked_solar_array\",\"display_name\":\"Cracked Solar Array\",\"flavour\":\"The crack runs the whole panel and the cells hang on by their backing — snag it wrong on the tether and you will be hauling glitter. Cheap glitter, this low down.\",\"reads_as\":[\"fragile\",\"low\",\"cheap\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\",\"4.3\"]},{\"id\":\"dented_fuel_bladder\",\"display_name\":\"Dented Fuel Bladder\",\"flavour\":\"Emptied, folded, and stove in on one side. It rides light and it sells for about what an empty bag ought to, which is the price of the low country.\",\"reads_as\":[\"light\",\"low\",\"cheap\",\"small\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"foil_insulation_bale\",\"display_name\":\"Foil Insulation Bale\",\"flavour\":\"Someone's thermal blanket wadded and strapped into a bale. Bulk without much bite on the tether, and bottom-of-the-band money for the trouble.\",\"reads_as\":[\"light\",\"low\",\"cheap\",\"small\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"collapsed_antenna_dish\",\"display_name\":\"Collapsed Antenna Dish\",\"flavour\":\"Folded in on itself like a dropped umbrella and still wider than your cockpit. It hangs where the scrap is cheap, and it eats the whole slot doing it.\",\"reads_as\":[\"low\",\"cheap\",\"oversized\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\",\"4.3\"]},{\"id\":\"reaction_wheel_housing\",\"display_name\":\"Reaction Wheel Housing\",\"flavour\":\"A dense little drum of machined casing, heavier in the hands than it looks. Compact enough to stow easy, but it's still low-country scrap.\",\"reads_as\":[\"low\",\"cheap\",\"solid\",\"small\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"snapped_boom_arm\",\"display_name\":\"Snapped Boom Arm\",\"flavour\":\"Broke clean at the joint and drifted off with the stub still attached. Awkward on the line, honest weight, and priced like everything else down here.\",\"reads_as\":[\"low\",\"cheap\",\"solid\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"shattered_camera_mast\",\"display_name\":\"Shattered Camera Mast\",\"flavour\":\"The optics head went first and the mast is holding its pieces together out of habit. Reel it in slow or you'll be selling gravel from the bargain end of the band.\",\"reads_as\":[\"fragile\",\"low\",\"cheap\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\",\"4.3\"]},{\"id\":\"battery_pallet\",\"display_name\":\"Battery Pallet\",\"flavour\":\"A strapped brick of dead cells on a frame. It pulls on the tether like a filing cabinet and pays like the low end of the envelope, which is to say barely.\",\"reads_as\":[\"low\",\"cheap\",\"solid\",\"small\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"torn_radiator_panel\",\"display_name\":\"Torn Radiator Panel\",\"flavour\":\"Tore along the coolant channels and the fins flex if you so much as look at them. Handle it like a sheet of ice with a bill attached.\",\"reads_as\":[\"fragile\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\",\"4.3\"]},{\"id\":\"cryo_tank_girdle\",\"display_name\":\"Cryo Tank Girdle\",\"flavour\":\"The banded collar off a cold tank, thick-walled and stubborn. It came off something big and it hauls like it.\",\"reads_as\":[\"solid\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"gyro_package\",\"display_name\":\"Gyro Package\",\"flavour\":\"A sealed can of spun metal, all of its weight packed into no space at all. Small in the bay, felt on the way down.\",\"reads_as\":[\"solid\",\"small\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"docking_collar\",\"display_name\":\"Docking Collar\",\"flavour\":\"A ring of latch hardware cut free of whatever it used to hold shut. Nothing delicate about it — just a lot of metal in a circle.\",\"reads_as\":[\"solid\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"buckled_truss_node\",\"display_name\":\"Buckled Truss Node\",\"flavour\":\"Where six spars met, now a knot of bent metal that won't lie flat in the bay. Heavy enough to argue with the tether the whole trip.\",\"reads_as\":[\"solid\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"optics_bench\",\"display_name\":\"Optics Bench\",\"flavour\":\"A mounting slab with the alignment glass still seated in it, and that glass is the whole reason to be careful. One hard swing and you are hauling a slab with nothing on it.\",\"reads_as\":[\"fragile\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\",\"4.3\"]},{\"id\":\"deployable_mast_cassette\",\"display_name\":\"Deployable Mast Cassette\",\"flavour\":\"A drum with a hundred metres of mast still coiled inside it, seized halfway out. Solid, mean, and it takes up more room than anything has a right to.\",\"reads_as\":[\"solid\",\"heavy\",\"oversized\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\",\"4.3\"]},{\"id\":\"ion_thruster_cluster\",\"display_name\":\"Ion Thruster Cluster\",\"flavour\":\"Four grids and their plumbing on a common mount, burnt through and welded together by heat. Dense little package, and it drags like it means it.\",\"reads_as\":[\"solid\",\"heavy\",\"small\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"cracked_pressure_dome\",\"display_name\":\"Cracked Pressure Dome\",\"flavour\":\"An endcap off a crew can with a fracture wandering across it. Half a tonne of hull that will finish splitting if you dock it hard — and up here that is real money to drop.\",\"reads_as\":[\"fragile\",\"high\",\"valuable\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"reactor_shield_plug\",\"display_name\":\"Reactor Shield Plug\",\"flavour\":\"A stub of dense shielding the size of a stool, and it hauls like the whole reactor came with it. Rich metal from the expensive end of the band.\",\"reads_as\":[\"heavy\",\"high\",\"valuable\",\"small\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"comsat_bus_frame\",\"display_name\":\"Comsat Bus Frame\",\"flavour\":\"The skeleton of a whole satellite with its guts still bolted in. Nearly a tonne of dense hardware from the top of the envelope, and it fights you every metre down.\",\"reads_as\":[\"heavy\",\"high\",\"valuable\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"telescope_mirror_segment\",\"display_name\":\"Telescope Mirror Segment\",\"flavour\":\"A tonne of ground glass on a backing frame, still holding its figure. It is worth the climb and it will shatter into worthless dust if you bring it in rough.\",\"reads_as\":[\"fragile\",\"high\",\"heavy\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"isotope_cask\",\"display_name\":\"Isotope Cask\",\"flavour\":\"A squat shielded drum that outweighs three of you and takes up the space of one. High-country payday, and your tank will notice every metre of it.\",\"reads_as\":[\"heavy\",\"high\",\"valuable\",\"small\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"solar_wing_spine\",\"display_name\":\"Solar Wing Spine\",\"flavour\":\"The full backbone of an array wing, panels stripped, still longer than your ship. It comes off the rich end of the band and it takes most of a tank to bring home.\",\"reads_as\":[\"heavy\",\"high\",\"valuable\",\"oversized\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\"]},{\"id\":\"scorched_reentry_cone\",\"display_name\":\"Scorched Reentry Cone\",\"flavour\":\"Something big came down wearing this once and it is charred through, the ablative crumbling wherever you grip. The heaviest thing on the board, the highest hanging, and the one most likely to come apart on the way to the deck.\",\"reads_as\":[\"heavy\",\"high\",\"fragile\",\"medium\"],\"grounded_in\":[\"2.6a\",\"5b\"]}],\"notes\":[\"The lightest piece in the table is scorched_hull_panel (62 kg) and the heaviest is scorched_reentry_cone (1600 kg); those two carry the required light/heavy claims by name.\",\"Middle-third pieces claim neither low nor high, and their flavour avoids placing them at either end of the envelope.\",\"Value language is kept to the gradient the passages describe (cheap low, expensive high) with no tiers or bands implied.\"]}","ttft_ms":44264,"ttft_stream_ms":2719,"time_to_request_ms":676,"type":"result","duration_ms":44447,"uuid":"611a20f9-0c73-4e4f-8ccc-73b52cba3aa3"}
